COMMANDS TO RUN APP:
.venv\Scripts\activate.bat --> activate virtual environment

flask --app app run --debug --> run dev server

http://127.0.0.1:5000/ --> dev server


HOW DOES THE APP WILL WORK??
Its a binary tree trasversal game with python flask and javascript

User will enter the correct order of each binay tree:
> Pre-order
> In-order
> Pos-order
> Combined

Individuals tabs per game

Since it's a game. There will be a clock, which i have to animate. Maybe a sandclock or normal clock (we'll see :0)
User will keep a record, which will be store on the browser to keep app simple

